#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<mtrace> [I<option>]... [I<binary>] I<mtracedata>\n"
msgstr "B<mtrace> [I<Option>]… [I<Programm>] I<mtracedaten>\n"

